# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# compiled output
dist
# Root-scoped on purpose: an unanchored `tmp` also swallowed the vendored bot
# builder's real source dir artifacts/dbot-builder/src/utils/tmp/ (its
# `dummy.tsx` Icon shim is imported by 8+ components), so the builder vanished
# from the repo and failed to build. Only the repo-root scratch dir is ignored.
/tmp
out-tsc
artifacts/dbot-builder/out/
*.tsbuildinfo
.expo
.expo-shared

# dependencies
node_modules

